      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Clarify expectations</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Avoid confusion</td>
          <td data-label="Practice">Write goals with each person</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Give regular feedback</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Prevents surprises</td>
          <td data-label="Practice">Weekly short check ins</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Protect focus time</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Team output</td>
          <td data-label="Practice">Limit meetings</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Habit"><strong>Admit mistakes</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Why">Builds trust</td>
          <td data-label="Practice">Share what you learned</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Leading people is a new skill and takes practice.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ecmoney">Pay and progression: reading claims carefully</h2>

  <p>
    Stories about fast promotion and high pay circulate widely, but firms, cities and economic cycles differ. Ask for ranges from people you can verify, and treat anonymous figures with caution.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Source</th>
          <th>Use</th>
          <th>Caution</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Source"><strong>Colleagues you trust</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Use">Realistic ranges</td>
          <td data-label="Caution">Small sample</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Source"><strong>Public notices</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Use">Entry level information</td>
          <td data-label="Caution">May omit allowances</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Source"><strong>Anonymous sites</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Use">General sense</td>
          <td data-label="Caution">Often unverified</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

